OL,3,AHow the Microsoft outage has been felt
OL,4,Aworldwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 74 countries have been
OL,7,Faffected by the Microsoft outage since
OL,8,Fit was detected after midday US Eastern
OL,9,FTime (17:00 GMT) on Thursday.
OL,11,FMicrosoft 365 Services, including
OL,12,FTeams, Outlook and artificial
OL,13,Fintelligence software Copilot, are
OL,14,Fexperiencing "connectivity problems",
OL,15,Fthe company said.
OL,17,FFrom city governments in the US to
OL,18,FAustralian spy agencies, disruption has
OL,19,Fbeen widespread. Here's what's been
OL,20,Fhappening around the world.
